[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2762.66, "timestamp": "00:46:02", "text": "我決定當"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2768.19, "timestamp": "00:46:08", "text": "志願者，那時根本沒人，所以我覺得自己有責任。後來我意識到，如果壓力太大，休息一下也是可以的。  是的，社區就是這樣。  它可能發生在任何地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2775.03, "timestamp": "00:46:15", "text": "不只是IMV之類的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2777.91, "timestamp": "00:46:17", "text": "我覺得 IVT 的內容跟我的全息影片、我的 VT、亞洲 YouTuber 的思維方式、國際 YouTuber 社群、歐洲 YouTuber 社群以及我這些年來看到的其他地方相比，都太少了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2783.108, "timestamp": "00:46:23", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i just feel like, in any sphere, when there is bound to be a big friend group, there will be issues "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.109, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "。所以，是的，當朋友圈很大時，肯定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2799.99, "timestamp": "00:46:39", "text": "會出現一些問題。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2803.43, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "text": "我的意思是，目前網路主播"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2806.22, "timestamp": "00:46:46", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "its much like walking dead, big grps bring more trouble"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2814.55, "timestamp": "00:46:54", "text": "圈子發展速度還很慢，規模也很小，但當它發展壯大之後，你就可以看到各種各樣的精彩劇情了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2819.474, "timestamp": "00:46:59", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oh yea"}]